  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The sum of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>, for which the points whose position vectors are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are coplanar, is equal to</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
