    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the given vectors be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>We know that if the vectors are coplanar then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On Simplifying we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, sum of the roots is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
